			<div class="content" id="post-content-4472626">
									

<p>So it appears that <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lambda-fairy" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1888005); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1888005&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1579374506" alt="Lambda Fairy" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1888005)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lambda-fairy" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1888005); return false;">Lambda Fairy</a></span> and I had similar reactions to discovering the theme of this contest:</p>
<blockquote>
<p><em><a href="https://www.merriam-webster.com/dictionary/mystery">mystery</a></em> (n.)<br />
3a: a religious truth that one can know only by revelation and cannot fully understand</p>
</blockquote>
<p>Two days, one literature review, and one silly joke from <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/djoric" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(388108); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=388108&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1579374506" alt="Djoric" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=388108)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/djoric" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(388108); return false;">Djoric</a></span>'s <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/breakfast-for-dinner">Breakfast for Dinner</a> later, and this is the result.</p>
<p>I cannot thank <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/miragetd" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3374709); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3374709&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1579374506" alt="MirageTD" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3374709)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/miragetd" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3374709); return false;">MirageTD</a></span> enough for slogging through all this ethology for me; you're awesome, man.</p>
<p>Alternative slots preferred: 5737, 5373, 5400, 5900, 5439</p>

