														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4473429">
									

<p>I appreciate the angle on the contest theme; take a pancultural mystery and make it the SCP. I think this could also work as an 001 in terms of scale, although I'm even less sure of its survivability there; the philosophical focus here may be too out-of-line with the site's primary interest for articles, which is entertainment value, especially in a contest like this. This goes for the academic tone too, despite its quality and also being what the Foundation would believably produce.</p>
<p>However, the sentiments here are gorgeous and I hope there is enough of an audience to keep this around&#8230; seems like there might be! I know there are people here who find this more entertaining than an exploration log!</p>
<p>For what it's worth, you have your finger on the philosophical pulse of our moment, and bring up questions here that define us as it relates to our contextualization in a historical narrative. I appreciate the hell out of this.</p>

							</div>

								
